# Linux HL/C build rendering through OpenGL ES 3.0 (EGL/SDL2), offline.
#
# Pair with a hashlink built with -DWITH_SDL_GLES=ON (sdl.hdll links libGLESv2).
# Differences from compile-linux.hxml:
#   -cp stubs first: stubs/datachannel replaces -lib datachannel (no WebRTC/TLS
#                    natives), stubs/haxe/io/FPHelper.hx makes FPHelper thread-safe.
#   -D gles          ES 3.0 context, no MSAA (see Main.hx).
#   -D offline       Http/MasterServer never touch the network (see Http.hx).
#   -D handheld      gamepad-only menus, clean quit, data/ check, handheld video defaults
#                    (see README-POCKETFORGE.md, Handheld build).
-cp stubs
-cp src
-lib heaps
-lib hlsdl
-lib colyseus-websocket
-D highDPI
-D flow_border
-D analyzer-optimize
-D linux
-D gles
-D offline
-D handheld
-hl native/marblegame.c
--main Main
